The data in this directory (representing GOT5.5D) consist of five
constituents of GOT5.5 which have been adjusted to attempt to account
for air-tide leakage in the current (as of 2024) DAC altimeter correction.
The adjustment is only partially successful, but it should help avoid
double-counting some signal, especially the M2 radiational tide.

These files should replace the corresponding files of GOT5.5, but ONLY
for altimeter work that also uses the DAC.  In all other applications,
do not use these files.

The adjustments are small enough that the load tides can be considered
unaffected; use the original GOT5.5 load tides.

R Ray   10 July 2024
